+        # Micikevicius et al. (2018), Mixed Precision Training (both unverified
+        # — lead to check: "PyTorch group_norm acc_type half"). Round 1's
+        # equations stay unchanged; A1 keeps pow backward intermediates in FP32.
+        dtype = x.dtype
